safix::clan_var_unknown

  × the mapping 'ntfy-token' names a var clan does not have.
  │ 
  │     machine     alice-workstation
  │     generator   ntfy
  │     file        token
  │ 
  │ Evaluation could not have caught this. The clan half of a mapping lives
  │ in another flake, and the only thing that can answer whether it resolves
  │ is clan itself.
  │ 
  │ Check the three names against clan's own list:
  │ 
  │     clan vars list alice-workstation
